{"availability":"available","full":"zyl0723/pta","name":"pta","description":"纯前端 C 语言习题检查器（PTA 基础题自检）：粘贴代码立即指出错误在第几行、为什么错、怎么改，并能在浏览器里真实运行、与期望输出逐行对比。可自带 API Key 用你自己的 AI 出答案、出练习题、翻译报错。无需后端、无需登录，代码不离开你的浏览器。","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-09T10:41:08Z","updated":"2026-10-12T13:59:13Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://zyl0723.github.io/pta/","topics":["c","c-language","code-checker","github-pages","interpreter","no-backend","pta","static-analysis","teaching-tool"],"demo":"https://zyl0723.github.io/pta/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:47:06.222Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:47:06.222Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:47:06.222Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:09.159Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:47:06.222Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["作者：zyl0723（）。本仓库自有代码版权归作者所有；用到的第三方组件（JSCPP 2.0.9、lodash 4.18.1、pegjs-util 1.4.21、printf 0.6.1、PEG.js 0.9.0、xterm.js 6.0.0、@xterm/addon-fit 0.11.0，均为 MIT）许可见 THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md。","一个纯前端网页工具，用来检查 PTA 平台上 C 语言基础题的代码。粘贴代码后，它会直白地指出问题出在哪一行、为什么错、怎么改，并且能真的把代码跑起来，把运行结果和题目要求的输出逐行对比。"],"features":["面向人群：初学 C 语言、在 PTA 上做题的学生。","设计底线：准确优先于覆盖面。只报有把握的问题，每条结论都同时给出「为什么」和「怎么改」；遇到无法确定的情况，明说无法确定，绝不编造结论误导学生。","隐私：所有计算都在浏览器本地完成，代码不会上传到任何服务器。"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zyl0723/pta/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8e387d041f4fd376657d16b29523e7fcf548a09321af6ad75704b2d7d032fba7","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:09.227Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:09.227Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"作者：zyl0723（）。本仓库自有代码版权归作者所有；用到的第三方组件（JSCPP 2.0.9、lodash 4.18.1、pegjs-util 1.4.21、printf 0.6.1、PEG.js 0.9.0、xterm.js 6.0.0、@xterm/addon-fit 0.11.0，均为 MIT）许可见 THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md。","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/zyl0723/pta/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"8e387d041f4fd376657d16b29523e7fcf548a09321af6ad75704b2d7d03